This file is a starting placeholder. Replace it with the full text of your
chosen license once you have audited your inputs (see below), and keep the
`license` value in firestarter.config.json in sync with whatever you put here.
The default is the most conservative choice on purpose: an unstated license is
treated by others as "all rights reserved", and starting there means you never
accidentally declare more than you hold.

----------------------------------------------------------------------
Scope of this license
----------------------------------------------------------------------

This license covers the first-party work in this repository and does not grant
rights to redistribute third-party inputs this project consumes or the
artifacts it derives from them. Vendored blobs, fonts, icon sets, sample or
seed data, model weights, scraped fixtures, and container base images arrive
under their own terms, which this license neither restates nor overrides.

You cannot know your outbound license until you audit your inputs. Before you
rely on the declaration above, enumerate what you redistribute and record the
terms each input arrives under: see docs/THIRD_PARTY_INPUTS.md. Do not declare
an outbound license broader than the narrowest input it covers.
